graph TD
    START([START]) --> planner

    planner -->|route_to_executor| executor
    planner -->|route_to_executor| executor_with_approval
    planner -->|route_to_executor| END

    executor -->|should_continue| tools
    executor -->|no tools| step_complete

    executor_with_approval -->|should_continue| tools
    executor_with_approval -->|awaiting_approval| END
    executor_with_approval -->|no tools| step_complete

    tools -->|route_after_tools| executor
    tools -->|route_after_tools| executor_with_approval

    step_complete -->|should_execute_next| executor
    step_complete -->|should_execute_next| executor_with_approval
    step_complete -->|should_execute_next| END

    END([END])

    classDef startEnd fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef node fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decision fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#4a148c,stroke-width:2px

    class START,END startEnd
    class planner,executor,executor_with_approval,step_complete,tools node
